  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPM-Peace and Rights Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is that people in the communities and FPFK are effective agents of peace, inclusive stability, and development. The target groups are women, young men, elders, local leaders, politicians, and church leaders. The main theme is Peaceful Coexistence and the geographic locations are Mt. Elgon and Muhoroni.</narrative>
  </description>
